    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;be in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>a</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>c</mi></math> be in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math> If the sum of first <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math> terms of an <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>, whose first term is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math> and the common difference is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>444</mn></math>,&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
