  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;be in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Also given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;are in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>c</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp; ..........(2)</p><p>Now from equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>57</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>74</mn><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>444</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>74</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>216</mn></math></p>",
